{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 19,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Better ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the poor that walketh in his integrity, than ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perverse in his lips, and is a fool.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the soul ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " without knowledge, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not good; and he that hasteth with ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " feet sinneth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The foolishness of man perverteth his way: and his heart fretteth against the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wealth maketh many friends; but the poor is separated from his neighbor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A false witness shall not be unpunished, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " speaketh lies shall not escape.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many will entreat the favor of the prince: and every man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a friend to him that giveth gifts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the brethren of the poor do hate him: how much more do his friends go far from him? he pursueth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them with",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " words, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wanting ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that getteth wisdom loveth his own soul: he that keepeth understanding shall find good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A false witness shall not be unpunished, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " speaketh lies shall perish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Delight is not seemly for a fool; much less for a servant to have rule over princes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The discretion of a man deferreth his anger; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his glory to pass over a transgression.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The king's wrath ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as the roaring of a lion; but his favor ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as dew upon the grass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A foolish son ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the calamity of his father: and the contentions of a wife ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a continual dropping.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "House and riches ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the inheritance of fathers: and a prudent wife ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Slothfulness casteth into a deep sleep; and an idle soul shall suffer hunger.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that keepeth the commandment keepeth his own soul; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that despiseth his ways shall die.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hath pity upon the poor, lendeth to the LORD; and that which he hath given will he pay him again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Chasten thy son while there is hope, and let not thy soul spare for his crying.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A man of great wrath shall suffer punishment: for if thou deliver ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", yet thou must do it again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear counsel, and receive instruction, that thou mayest be wise in thy latter end.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " many devices in a man's heart; nevertheless the counsel of the LORD, that shall stand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The desire of a man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his kindness: and a poor man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " better than a liar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to life: and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that hath it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall abide satisfied; he shall not be visited with evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A slothful ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hideth his hand in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bosom, and will not so much as bring it to his mouth again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Smite a scorner and the simple will beware: and reprove one that hath understanding, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he will understand knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that wasteth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " father, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " chaseth away ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mother, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a son that causeth shame, and bringeth reproach.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cease, my son, to hear the instruction ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that causeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to err from the words of knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "An ungodly witness scorneth judgment: and the mouth of the wicked devoureth iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.19.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.19.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Judgments are prepared for scorners, and stripes for the back of fools.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
